{
    "title": "Tapas \u2013 Comics and Novels",
    "description": "The Ultimate App for Comics, Novels, Mangas, Manhwas, Webtoons and More!\u2014Discover Your Next Favorite Story with Tapas\r\n\r\nLove comic books and engaging stories? Looking for the perfect way to pass the time? Tapas is the go-to app for those who crave captivating tales. Whether you love romance, action, fantasy, or BL, Tapas has something for everyone. Discover new chapters released daily, with exclusive free episodes dropping every three hours. \r\n\r\nGet hooked on international sensations and trending Tapas Original Series like:\r\n\r\n- The Beginning After the End\r\n- Solo Leveling\r\n- Little Rabbit and the Big Bad Leopard\r\n- A Business Proposal\r\n- Heartstopper\r\n- Moving\r\n\r\nOnly on Tapas, you can enjoy many of these mega-hit series in both webcomic and novel versions. And thanks to the Wait-Until-Free system, you can enjoy them for free! Simply wait for your timer to run out, and you can read the next episode for free. Or, grab multiple episodes in bundles with the best deal to keep the excitement going!\r\n\r\nNo need to stop at a bookstore or the library to read comic books when you can explore an endless library of stories spanning everything from premium comics/novels, Tapas Originals, K-content, to indie comics, right in the palm of your hand. Indulge in isekai adventures, otome game stories, breathtaking romantasy, and so on!\r\n\r\nDownload the app and engage with 10 million other readers and creators. Get notified about updates on your favorite series. Plus, you\u2019ll have access to app-exclusive perks like Gift Passes and free Ink. Try your luck on the weekly Fortune Cookies every Monday carrying random amounts of bonus Ink!\r\n\r\nWant to write your own epic saga? Tapas is also the perfect platform to share your creativity with a supportive global audience. Join over 75,000 talented creators\u2014from established, award-winning authors to aspiring independent artists\u2014and publish your work on Tapas.\r\n\r\nTurn your phone time into story time with Tapas\u2014your go-to destination for the comic books, romance stories, and episodes you crave!\r\n\r\nWebsite: http://www.tapas.io\r\nEmail: feedback@tapas.io\r\nInstagram: @tapas_app\r\nTwitter: @tapas_app\r\nFacebook: Tapas",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Ultimate App for Comics, Novels, Mangas, Manhwas, Webtoons and More!\u2014Discover Your Next Favorite Story with Tapas<br><br>Love comic books and engaging stories? Looking for the perfect way to pass the time? Tapas is the go-to app for those who crave captivating tales. Whether you love romance, action, fantasy, or BL, Tapas has something for everyone. Discover new chapters released daily, with exclusive free episodes dropping every three hours. <br><br>Get hooked on international sensations and trending Tapas Original Series like:<br><br>- The Beginning After the End<br>- Solo Leveling<br>- Little Rabbit and the Big Bad Leopard<br>- A Business Proposal<br>- Heartstopper<br>- Moving<br><br>Only on Tapas, you can enjoy many of these mega-hit series in both webcomic and novel versions. And thanks to the Wait-Until-Free system, you can enjoy them for free! Simply wait for your timer to run out, and you can read the next episode for free. Or, grab multiple episodes in bundles with the best deal to keep the excitement going!<br><br>No need to stop at a bookstore or the library to read comic books when you can explore an endless library of stories spanning everything from premium comics/novels, Tapas Originals, K-content, to indie comics, right in the palm of your hand. Indulge in isekai adventures, otome game stories, breathtaking romantasy, and so on!<br><br>Download the app and engage with 10 million other readers and creators. Get notified about updates on your favorite series. Plus, you\u2019ll have access to app-exclusive perks like Gift Passes and free Ink. Try your luck on the weekly Fortune Cookies every Monday carrying random amounts of bonus Ink!<br><br>Want to write your own epic saga? Tapas is also the perfect platform to share your creativity with a supportive global audience. Join over 75,000 talented creators\u2014from established, award-winning authors to aspiring independent artists\u2014and publish your work on Tapas.<br><br>Turn your phone time into story time with Tapas\u2014your go-to destination for the comic books, romance stories, and episodes you crave!<br><br>Website: http://www.tapas.io<br>Email: feedback@tapas.io<br>Instagram: @tapas_app<br>Twitter: @tapas_app<br>Facebook: Tapas",
